@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Danh sach bai tap — 200 (Client tu loc IsOpen)
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 2. Chi tiet bai tap 1 — 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/1

### 3. Bai tap khong ton tai — 404 ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/999

### 4. Tao bai nop — 201; chay lai server truoc khi chay lai ca nay
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":"CORE-SV001","repositoryUrl":"https://github.com/vietdotest/EduSubmit-DTC245200604"}

### 5. Doc bai vua tao — 200; gui ca 4 truoc
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 6. Du lieu rong — 400 INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":"","repositoryUrl":""}

### 7. Guid.Empty khong ton tai — 404 SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
